    <string name="about_disclaimer_section">Notice</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">This project is intended for technical exploration and personal learning and does not constitute investment advice. Crypto assets are highly volatile, and displayed market data may be delayed or inaccurate; refer to the relevant trading platform for authoritative data. Binance, OKX, DexScreener, GeckoTerminal, and related names, trademarks, and APIs belong to their respective owners.</string>

